(Page 6 of 54 - 01 - Introduction  to Agents) Tj T*
(Introduction to Agents) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(6) Tj T*
(From Predictive AI to) Tj T*
(Autonomous Agents) Tj T*
(Artificial intelligence is changing. For years, the focus has been on models that excel at) Tj T*
(passive, discrete tasks: answering a question, translating text, or generating an image from) Tj T*
(a prompt. This paradigm, while powerful, requires constant human direction for every step.) Tj T*
(We're now seeing a paradigm shift, moving from AI that just predicts or creates content to a) Tj T*
(new class of software capable of autonomous problem-solving and task execution.) Tj T*
(This new frontier is built around AI agents. An agent is not simply an AI model in a static) Tj T*
(workflow; it's a complete application, making plans and taking actions to achieve goals. It) Tj T*
(combines a Language Model's \(LM\) ability to reason with the practical ability to act, allowing) Tj T*
(Agents are the natural evolution) Tj T*
(of Language Models, made useful) Tj T*
(in software.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
