(Page 10 of 54 - 01 - Introduction  to Agents) Tj T*
(Introduction to Agents) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(10) Tj T*
(critical components: domain expertise, a defined personality, and seamless integration) Tj T*
(with the tools necessary for practical task completion. It's crucial to remember that) Tj T*
(comprehensive evaluations and assessments often outweigh the initial prompt's influence.) Tj T*
(When an agent is precisely configured with clear instructions, reliable tools, and an) Tj T*
(integrated context serving as memory, a great user interface, the ability to plan and problem) Tj T*
(solve, and general world knowledge, it transcends the notion of mere "workflow automation.") Tj T*
(It begins to function as a collaborative entity: a highly efficient, uniquely adaptable, and) Tj T*
(remarkably capable new member of your team.) Tj T*
(In essence, an agent is a system dedicated to the art of context window curation. It) Tj T*
(is a relentless loop of assembling context, prompting the model, observing the result,) Tj T*
(and then re-assembling a context for the next step. The context may include system) Tj T*
(instructions, user input, session history, long term memories, grounding knowledge from) Tj T*
(authoritative sources, what tools could be used, and the results of tools already invoked.) Tj T*
(This sophisticated management of the model's attention allows its reasoning capabilities) Tj T*
(to problem solve for novel circumstances and accomplish objectives.) Tj T*
(The Agentic Problem-Solving Process) Tj T*
(We have defined an AI agent as a complete, goal-oriented application that integrates a) Tj T*
(reasoning model, actionable tools, and a governing orchestration layer. A short version is) Tj T*
("LMs in a loop with tools to accomplish an objective.") Tj T*
(But how does this system actually work? What does an agent do from the moment it receives) Tj T*
(a request to the moment it delivers a result?) Tj T*
ET
