(Page 12 of 54 - 01 - Introduction  to Agents) Tj T*
(Introduction to Agents) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(12) Tj T*
(This "Think, Act, Observe" cycle continues - managed by the Orchestration Layer, reasoned) Tj T*
(by the Model, and executed by the Tools until the agent's internal plan is complete and the) Tj T*
(initial Mission is achieved.) Tj T*
(Figure 1: Agentic AI problem-solving process) Tj T*
(Let's take a real-world example of how a Customer Support Agent would operate in this) Tj T*
(5-step cycle:) Tj T*
(Imagine a user asks, "Where is my order #12345?") Tj T*
ET
