(Level 3: The Collaborative Multi-Agent System) Tj T*
(At the highest level, the paradigm shifts entirely. We move away from building a single, all-) Tj T*
(powerful "super-agent" and toward a "team of specialists" working in concert, a model that) Tj T*
(directly mirrors a human organization. The system's collective strength lies in this division of) Tj T*
(labor.) Tj T*
(Here, agents treat other agents as tools. Imagine a "Project Manager" agent receiving a) Tj T*
("Mission": "Launch our new 'Solaris' headphones.") Tj T*
(The Project Manager agent doesn't do the entire work itself. It Acts by creating new Missions) Tj T*
