(Page 20 of 54 - 01 - Introduction  to Agents) Tj T*
(Introduction to Agents) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(20) Tj T*
(You may choose more than one model, a "team of specialists." You don't use a sledgehammer) Tj T*
(to crack a nut. A robust agent architecture might use a frontier model like Gemini 3.2 Pro) Tj T*
(for the heavy lifting of initial planning and complex reasoning, but then intelligently route) Tj T*
(simpler, high-volume tasks--like classifying user intent or summarizing text--to a much faster) Tj T*
(and more cost-effective model like Gemini 3.2 Flash series or open models like Gemma 4.) Tj T*
(Model routing might be automatic or hard-coded but is a key strategy for optimizing both) Tj T*
(performance and cost9.) Tj T*
(The same principle applies to handling diverse data types. While a natively multimodal) Tj T*
(model like Gemini live mode10 offers a streamlined path to processing images and audio,) Tj T*
(an alternative is to use specialized tools like the Cloud Vision API11 or Speech-to-Text API12.) Tj T*
(In this pattern, the world is first converted to text, which is then passed to a language-only) Tj T*
(model for reasoning. This adds flexibility and allows for best-of-breed components, but also) Tj T*
(introduces significant complexity.) Tj T*
(Finally, the AI landscape is in a state of constant, rapid evolution. The model you choose) Tj T*
(today will be superseded in six months. A "set it and forget it" mindset is unsustainable.) Tj T*
(Building for this reality means investing in a nimble operational framework--an "Agent Ops") Tj T*
(practice13. With a robust CI/CD pipeline that continuously evaluates new models against your) Tj T*
(key business metrics, you can de-risk and accelerate upgrades, ensuring your agent is always) Tj T*
(powered by the best brain available without requiring a complete architectural overhaul.) Tj T*
(Tools: The "Hands" of your AI Agent) Tj T*
(If the model is the agent's brain, tools are the hands that connect its reasoning to reality.) Tj T*
(They allow the agent to move beyond its static training data to retrieve real-time information) Tj T*
(and take action in the world. A robust tool interface is a three-part loop: defining what a tool) Tj T*
(can do, invoking it, and observing the result.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
