(Page 23 of 54 - 01 - Introduction  to Agents) Tj T*
(Introduction to Agents) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(23) Tj T*
(Core Design Choices) Tj T*
(The first architectural decision is determining the agent's degree of autonomy. The choice) Tj T*
(exists on a spectrum. At one end, you have deterministic, predictable workflows that call an) Tj T*
(LM as a tool for a specific task--a sprinkle of AI to augment an existing process. At the other) Tj T*
(end, you have the LM in the driver's seat, dynamically adapting, planning and executing tasks) Tj T*
(to achieve a goal.) Tj T*
(A parallel choice is the implementation method. No-code builders offer speed and) Tj T*
(accessibility, empowering business users to automate structured tasks and build simple) Tj T*
(agents rapidly. For more complex, mission-critical systems, code-first frameworks, such as) Tj T*
(Google's Agent Development Kit \(ADK\)18, provide the deep control, customizability, and) Tj T*
(integration capabilities that engineers require.) Tj T*
(Regardless of the approach, a production-grade framework is essential. It must be open,) Tj T*
(allowing you to plug in any model or tool to prevent vendor lock-in. It must provide precise) Tj T*
(control, enabling a hybrid approach where the non-deterministic reasoning of an LM is) Tj T*
(governed by hard-coded business rules. Most importantly, the framework must be built for) Tj T*
(observability. When an agent behaves unexpectedly, you cannot simply put a breakpoint in) Tj T*
(the model's "thought." A robust framework generates detailed traces and logs, exposing the) Tj T*
(entire reasoning trajectory: the model's internal monologue, the tool it chose, the parameters) Tj T*
(it generated, and the result it observed.) Tj T*
(Instruct with Domain Knowledge and Persona) Tj T*
(Within this framework, the developer's most powerful lever is to instruct the agent with) Tj T*
(domain knowledge and a distinct persona. This is accomplished through a system prompt) Tj T*
(or a set of core instructions. This isn't just a simple command; it is the agent's constitution.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
