(with the support from Domain experts. To operationalize this, the Gemini Enterprise) Tj T*
(Agent Platform provides dedicated tools like Agent Simulation and Agent Evaluation,) Tj T*
(allowing teams to automatically score, stress-test, and guarantee quality before launching) Tj T*
(into production.) Tj T*
(Metrics-Driven Development: Your Go/No-Go for Deployment) Tj T*
(Once you have automated dozens of evaluation scenarios and established trusted quality) Tj T*
(scores, you can confidently test changes to your development agent. The process is simple:) Tj T*
(run the new version against the entire evaluation dataset, and directly compare its scores) Tj T*
(to the existing production version. This robust system eliminates guesswork, ensuring you) Tj T*
(are confident in every deployment. While automated evaluations are critical, don't forget) Tj T*
(other important factors like latency, cost, and task success rates. For maximum safety, use) Tj T*
(A/B deployments to slowly roll out new versions and compare these real-world production) Tj T*
(metrics alongside your simulation scores.) Tj T*
(Debug with OpenTelemetry Traces: Answering "Why?") Tj T*
(When your metrics dip or a user reports a bug, you need to understand "why." An) Tj T*
(OpenTelemetry trace is a high-fidelity, step-by-step recording of the agent's entire execution) Tj T*
(path \(trajectory\), allowing you to debug the agent's steps.25 With traces, you can see the) Tj T*
(exact prompt sent to the model, the model's internal reasoning \(if available\), the specific) Tj T*
(tool it chose to call, the precise parameters it generated for that tool, and the raw data that) Tj T*
(came back as an observation. Traces can be complicated the first time you look at them but) Tj T*
(they provide the details needed to diagnose and fix the root cause of any issue.  Important) Tj T*
(trace details may be turned into metrics, but reviewing traces is primarily for debugging, not) Tj T*
(overviews of performance. Trace data can be seamlessly collected in platforms like Google) Tj T*
ET
