(Cherish Human Feedback: Guiding Your Automation) Tj T*
(Human feedback is not an annoyance to be dealt with; it is the most valuable and data-) Tj T*
(rich resource you have for improving your agent. When a user files a bug report or clicks) Tj T*
(the "thumbs down" button, they are giving you a gift: a new, real-world edge case that) Tj T*
(your automated eval scenarios missed. Collecting and aggregating this data is critical;) Tj T*
(when you see a statistically significant number of similar reports or metric dips, you must) Tj T*
(tie the occurrences back to your analytics platform to generate insights and trigger alerts) Tj T*
(for operational issues. An effective Agent Ops process "closes the loop" by capturing this) Tj T*
(feedback, replicating the issue, and converting that specific scenario into a new, permanent) Tj T*
(test case in your evaluation dataset. This ensures you not only fix the bug but also vaccinate) Tj T*
(the system against that entire class of error ever happening again.) Tj T*
