(33) Tj T*
(This capability fundamentally changes the nature of agent-human collaboration. With access) Tj T*
(to a device's camera and microphone, the agent can see what the user sees and hear what) Tj T*
(they say, responding with generated speech at a latency that mimics human conversation.) Tj T*
(This opens up a vast array of use cases that are simply impossible with text, from a) Tj T*
(technician receiving hands-free guidance while repairing a piece of equipment to a shopper) Tj T*
(getting real-time style advice. It makes the agent a more intuitive and accessible partner.) Tj T*
(Agents and Agents) Tj T*
(Just as agents must connect with humans, they must also connect with each other. As an) Tj T*
(enterprise scales its use of AI, different teams will build different specialized agents. Without) Tj T*
(a common standard, connecting them would require building a tangled web of brittle, custom) Tj T*
(API integrations that are impossible to maintain. The core challenge is twofold: discovery) Tj T*
(\(how does my agent find other agents and know what they can do?\) and communication \(how) Tj T*
(do we ensure they speak the same language?\).) Tj T*
(The Agent2Agent \(A2A\) protocol is the open standard designed to solve this problem. It) Tj T*
(acts as a universal handshake for the agentic economy. A2A allows any agent to publish a) Tj T*
(digital "business card," known as an Agent Card. This simple JSON file advertises the agent's) Tj T*
(capabilities, its network endpoint, and the security credentials required to interact with it.) Tj T*
(This makes discovery simple and standardized. As opposed to MCP which focuses on solving) Tj T*
(transactional requests, Agent 2 Agent communication is typically for additional problem) Tj T*
(solving.) Tj T*
(Once discovered, agents communicate using a task-oriented architecture. Instead of a) Tj T*
(simple request-response, interactions are framed as asynchronous "tasks." A client agent) Tj T*
(sends a task request to a server agent, which can then provide streaming updates as it works) Tj T*
(on the problem over a long-running connection. This robust, standardized communication) Tj T*
ET
endstream
