(Page 35 of 54 - 01 - Introduction  to Agents) Tj T*
(Introduction to Agents) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(35) Tj T*
(Securing a Single Agent: The Trust Trade-Off) Tj T*
(When you create your first AI agent, you immediately face a fundamental tension: the) Tj T*
(trade-off between utility and security. To make an agent useful, you must give it power--the) Tj T*
(autonomy to make decisions and the tools to perform actions like sending emails or querying) Tj T*
(databases. However, every ounce of power you grant introduces a corresponding measure of) Tj T*
(risk. The primary security concerns are rogue actions--unintended or harmful behaviors--) Tj T*
(and sensitive data disclosure. You want to give your agent a leash long enough to do its) Tj T*
(job, but short enough to keep it from running into traffic, especially when that traffic involves) Tj T*
(irreversible actions or your company's private data.32) Tj T*
(To manage this, you cannot rely solely on the AI model's judgment, as it can be manipulated) Tj T*
(by techniques like prompt injection33. Instead, the best practice is a hybrid, defense-in-) Tj T*
(depth approach.34 The first layer consists of traditional, deterministic guardrails--a set of) Tj T*
(hardcoded rules that act as a security chokepoint outside the model's reasoning. This could) Tj T*
(be a policy engine that blocks any purchase over $100 or requires explicit user confirmation) Tj T*
(before the agent can interact with an external API. This layer provides predictable, auditable) Tj T*
(hard limits on the agent's power.) Tj T*
(The second layer leverages reasoning-based defenses, using AI to help secure AI. This) Tj T*
(involves training the model to be more resilient to attacks \(adversarial training\) and employing) Tj T*
(smaller, specialized "guard models" that act like security analysts. These models can examine) Tj T*
(the agent's proposed plan before it's executed, flagging potentially risky or policy-violating) Tj T*
(steps for review. This hybrid model, combining the rigid certainty of code with the contextual) Tj T*
(awareness of AI, creates a robust security posture for even a single agent, ensuring its power) Tj T*
(is always aligned with its purpose.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
