(38) Tj T*
(Securing an ADK Agent) Tj T*
(With the core principles of identity and policy established, securing an agent built with the) Tj T*
(Agent Development Kit \(ADK\) becomes a practical exercise in applying those concepts) Tj T*
(through code and configuration37.) Tj T*
(As described above, the process requires a clear definition of identities: user account \(for) Tj T*
(example OAuth\), service account \(to run code\), agent identity \(to use delegated authority\).) Tj T*
(Once authentication is handled, the next layer of defense involves establishing policies to) Tj T*
(constrain access to services.  This is often done at the API governance layer, along with) Tj T*
(governance supporting MCP and A2A services.) Tj T*
(The next layer is building guardrails into your tools, models, and sub-agents to enforce) Tj T*
(policies. This ensures that no matter what the LM reasons or what a malicious prompt) Tj T*
(might suggest, the tool's own logic will refuse to execute an unsafe or out-of-policy action.) Tj T*
(This approach provides a predictable and auditable security baseline, translating abstract) Tj T*
(security policies into concrete, reliable code38.) Tj T*
(For more dynamic security that can adapt to the agent's runtime behavior, ADK provides) Tj T*
(Callbacks and Plugins. A before_tool_callback allows you to inspect the parameters) Tj T*
(of a tool call before it runs, validating them against the agent's current state to prevent) Tj T*
(misaligned actions. For more reusable policies, you can build plugins. A common pattern is a) Tj T*
("Gemini as a Judge"39 that uses a fast, inexpensive model like Gemini Flash-Lite or your own) Tj T*
(fine-tuned Gemma model to screen user inputs and agent outputs for prompt injections or) Tj T*
(harmful content in real time.) Tj T*
(Within the Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform, Agent Gateway acts as the air traffic control) Tj T*
(for your ecosystem. It provides secure, unified connectivity while natively enforcing Model) Tj T*
(Armor protections to safeguard against prompt injection and data leakage. Model Armor) Tj T*
ET
endstream
