(42) Tj T*
(it enables a formal lifecycle for agents and tools, allowing for security reviews before) Tj T*
(publication, versioning, and the creation of fine-grained policies that dictate which) Tj T*
(business units can access which agents. This is managed through the new Agent) Tj T*
(Registry, a central library that indexes every internal agent, tool, and skill \(including) Tj T*
(reusable Skills for codified workflows\), simplifying discovery and ensuring only approved) Tj T*
(assets are available.) Tj T*
(By combining a runtime gateway with a central governance registry, an organization) Tj T*
(transforms the risk of chaotic sprawl into a managed, secure, and efficient ecosystem.) Tj T*
(Cost and Reliability: The Infrastructure Foundation) Tj T*
(Ultimately, enterprise-grade agents must be both reliable and cost-effective. An agent) Tj T*
(that frequently fails or provides slow results has a negative ROI. Conversely, an agent) Tj T*
(that is prohibitively expensive cannot scale to meet business demands. The underlying) Tj T*
(infrastructure must be designed to manage this trade-off, securely and with regulatory and) Tj T*
(data sovereignty compliance.) Tj T*
(In some cases, the feature you need is scale-to-zero, when you have irregular traffic to) Tj T*
(a specific agent or sub-function. For mission-critical, latency-sensitive workloads, the) Tj T*
(platform must offer dedicated, guaranteed capacity, such as Provisioned Throughput41 for) Tj T*
(LM services or 99.9% Service Level Agreements \(SLAs\) for runtimes like Cloud Run42. This) Tj T*
(provides a predictable performance, ensuring that your most important agents are always) Tj T*
(responsive, even under heavy load. By providing this spectrum of infrastructure options,) Tj T*
(coupled with comprehensive monitoring for both cost and performance, you establish the) Tj T*
(final, essential foundation for scaling AI agents from a promising innovation into a core,) Tj T*
(reliable component of the enterprise.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
