(Page 47 of 54 - 01 - Introduction  to Agents) Tj T*
(Introduction to Agents) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(47) Tj T*
(Examples of advanced agents) Tj T*
(Google Co-Scientist) Tj T*
(Co-Scientist is an advanced AI agent designed to function as a virtual research collaborator,) Tj T*
(accelerating scientific discovery by systematically exploring complex problem spaces. It) Tj T*
(enables researchers to define a goal, ground the agent in specified public and proprietary) Tj T*
(knowledge sources, and then generate and evaluate a landscape of novel hypotheses.) Tj T*
(In order to be able to achieve this, Co-Scientist spawns a whole ecosystem of agents) Tj T*
(collaborating with each other.) Tj T*
(Figure 8: The AI co-scientist design system) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
99 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Contents 100 0 R /Resources << /Font << /F1 3 0 R >> >> >>
