stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
36 756 Td
13 TL
(Page 48 of 54 - 01 - Introduction  to Agents) Tj T*
(Introduction to Agents) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(48) Tj T*
(Think of the system as a research project manager. The AI first takes a broad research) Tj T*
(goal and creates a detailed project plan. A "Supervisor" agent then acts as the manager,) Tj T*
(delegating tasks to a team of specialized agents and distributing resources like computing) Tj T*
(power. This structure ensures the project can easily scale up and that the team's methods) Tj T*
(improve as they work toward the final goal.) Tj T*
(Figure 9: Co-scientist multi agent workflow) Tj T*
(The various agents work for hours, or even days, and keep improving the generated) Tj T*
(hypotheses, running loops and meta loops that improve not only the generated ideas, but) Tj T*
(also the way that we judge and create new ideas.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
