(Page 49 of 54 - 01 - Introduction  to Agents) Tj T*
(Introduction to Agents) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(49) Tj T*
(AlphaEvolve Agent) Tj T*
(Another example of an advanced agentis system is AlphaEvolve, an AI agent that discovers) Tj T*
(and optimizes algorithms for complex problems in mathematics and computer science.) Tj T*
(AlphaEvolve works by combining the creative code generation of our Gemini language) Tj T*
(models with an automated evaluation system. It uses an evolutionary process: the AI) Tj T*
(generates potential solutions, an evaluator scores them, and the most promising ideas are) Tj T*
(used as inspiration for the next generation of code.) Tj T*
(This approach has already led to significant breakthroughs, including:) Tj T*
(* Improving the efficiency of Google's data centers, chip design, and AI training.) Tj T*
(* Discovering faster matrix multiplication algorithms.) Tj T*
(* Finding new solutions to open mathematical problems.) Tj T*
(AlphaEvolve excels at problems46 where verifying the quality of a solution is far easier than) Tj T*
(finding it in the first place.) Tj T*
(Figure 10: Alpha Evolve design system) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
103 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Contents 104 0 R /Resources << /Font << /F1 3 0 R >> >> >>
