(Page 50 of 54 - 01 - Introduction  to Agents) Tj T*
(Introduction to Agents) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(50) Tj T*
(AlphaEvolve is designed for a deep, iterative partnership between humans and AI. This) Tj T*
(collaboration works in two main ways:) Tj T*
(* Transparent Solutions: The AI generates solutions as human-readable code. This) Tj T*
(transparency allows users to understand the logic, gain insights, trust the results, and) Tj T*
(directly modify the code for their needs.) Tj T*
(* Expert Guidance: Human expertise is essential for defining the problem. Users guide the) Tj T*
(AI by refining evaluation metrics and steering the exploration, which prevents the system) Tj T*
(from exploiting unintended loopholes in the problem's definition. This interactive loop) Tj T*
(ensures the final solutions are both powerful and practical.) Tj T*
(The result of the agent is a continuous improvement of the code that keeps improving the) Tj T*
(metrics specified by the human.) Tj T*
(Figure 11: Algorithm evolution) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
